     "content_html": "<img alt=\"The figure has a parabola opening up graphed on the x y-coordinate plane. The x-axis runs from negative 6 to 6. The y-axis runs from negative 4 to 8. The parabola goes through the points (negative 2, 6), (1, 3), (0, 2), (1, 3), and (2, 6).\" class=\"img-fluid atto_image_button_text-bottom\" height=\"235\" src=\"exercises/media/2cf26fed36545b57.jpg\" width=\"229\">"
